// The benchmark district's day (M5 B2, M6 B4): a midday key, a dusk key and a night key, which the district's zone
// names (`day`), so its look is its own wherever it opens (M5 M6). `--time-of-day 13` stands at the midday key, with
// the sun up (M6 B4: the district's daylight, which M5's units never drew), `--time-of-day 19.75` at the dusk key and
// `--time-of-day 23` at the night key. Between two keys they blend: from 13:00 the day turns to dusk, from 19:45 the
// dusk to night, and from 23:00 round to 13:00 the night back to day. The dusk and night keys, and the hours between
// them, are M5's as they were, so a run between 19:45 and 23:00 draws what M5 measured. The dusk and night keys are
// the look-dev day's blue hour and nightfall and the midday key its midday (`content/lookdev/lookdev_day.ron`),
// whose comments say what each group is for; the night key keeps nightfall's values at 23:00. A `TodTimeline`
// document (`sapphire_world::tod`): the zone's cook checks it and holds its text.
